# ${{ values.apiName }}

${{ values.description }}

`${{ values.apiName }}` is an Amazon API Gateway REST API. Every route is
served by one AWS Lambda function (`${{ values.runtime }}`). The
infrastructure is defined with Terraform in `infra/` and uses the platform's
shared Terraform modules.

## What this repository creates

| Part | Resource | Setting |
| ---- | -------- | ------- |
| API | API Gateway REST API, regional endpoint | Stage `v${{ (values.apiVersion or '1.0.0').split('.')[0] }}` (version ${{ values.apiVersion or '1.0.0' }}) |
| Function | Lambda function `${{ values.apiName }}` | `${{ values.runtime }}`, ${{ values.memorySize or 512 }} MB, ${{ values.timeout or 30 }} s timeout |
{%- if values.enableCRUD %}
| Storage | DynamoDB table `${{ values.apiName }}-items` | On-demand, encrypted, point-in-time recovery |
{%- endif %}
{%- if authType == 'jwt' %}
| Authentication | Lambda authorizer `${{ values.apiName }}-authorizer` | Bearer tokens of `${{ values.jwtIssuer | replace('|', '\\|') }}` for audience `${{ values.jwtAudience | replace('|', '\\|') }}` |
{%- elif authType == 'apikey' %}
| Authentication | API key and usage plan | Key sent in the `x-api-key` header |
{%- elif authType == 'cognito' %}
| Authentication | Cognito user pool and app client | ID token sent in the `Authorization` header |
{%- else %}
| Authentication | None | The API is public |
{%- endif %}
{%- if values.enableWAF %}
| Firewall | AWS WAF web ACL on the stage | AWS managed rule groups{% if values.rateLimiting %}, rate-based rule per client address{% endif %} |
{%- endif %}
{%- if values.rateLimiting %}
| Rate limiting | Stage throttling{% if authType == 'apikey' %} and usage plan{% endif %} | ${{ values.requestsPerSecond or 100 }} requests per second, burst ${{ (values.requestsPerSecond or 100) * 2 }} |
{%- endif %}
{%- if values.enableMonitoring %}
| Monitoring | Access logs, detailed metrics, four alarms, dashboard `${{ values.apiName }}` | Logs kept ${{ values.logRetention or 30 }} days |
{%- else %}
| Logging | Function log group | Logs kept ${{ values.logRetention or 30 }} days |
{%- endif %}
{%- if values.enableXRay %}
| Tracing | AWS X-Ray on the stage and the function | Active tracing |
{%- endif %}

Nothing exists in AWS until the configuration is applied; see
[Operations](operations.md).

